--     + 1x Samosa @40 = 420 subtotal, tax 21.00, Welcome50 flat -50,
--     fee +1  => GRAND 392.00, paid. Loyalty earn floor(392/10) = 39 pts.
--   Order B (preparing/dine-in T1/Priya/upi): 1x Masala Chai @60
--     + 1x Vada Pav @50 = 110 subtotal, tax 5.50, fee +1
--     => GRAND 116.50, paid (gateway seed-upi-001). T1 stays occupied.
--   Order C (new/delivery/Amit/card): 1x Latte @160 + Oat Milk @40 = 200
--     + 1x Sandwich @80 = 280 subtotal, tax 14.00, Monsoon10 -28.00,
--     fee +1 => GRAND 267.00, UNPAID (no payment row yet).
